    "label": "thm:finite",
    "number": "Theorem 1",
    "quote": "Consider an epoch schedule such that $\\tau_{m}\\le2\\tau_{m-1},\\,\\forall m>1$ and $\\tau_1\\le2$. Let $c=1/30$. For any $T\\in\\N$, with probability at least $1-\\delta$, the regret of Algorithm \\ref{alg:cbor} after $T$ rounds is at most $O\\left(\\sqrt{KT\\log(|\\cF|m(T)/\\delta)}\\right)$."
   },
