   "notes": "Regret is realized regret vs globally optimal policy pi_{f*}, bounded w.p. 1-delta. With tau_m=2^m gives O(sqrt(KT log(|F| log T/delta))) with O(log T) oracle calls. Compute polynomial relative to the least squares oracle."
  },
